  <StreamGeometry x:Key="Icon.Keyboard">M4 4 H20 A2 2 0 0 1 22 6 V18 A2 2 0 0 1 20 20 H4 A2 2 0 0 1 2 18 V6 A2 2 0 0 1 4 4 Z M6 8 h0.01 M10 8 h0.01 M14 8 h0.01 M18 8 h0.01 M12 12 h0.01 M16 12 h0.01 M7 16 H17</StreamGeometry>

